    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Continue stedfastly in prayer, watching therein with thanksgiving; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "withal praying for us also, that God may open unto us a door for the word, to speak the mystery of Christ, for which I am also in bonds; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that I may make it manifest, as I ought to speak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walk in wisdom toward them that are without, redeeming the time. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let your speech be always with grace, seasoned with salt, that ye may know how ye ought to answer each one.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All my affairs shall Tychicus make known unto you, the beloved brother and faithful minister and fellow-servant in the Lord: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "whom I have sent unto you for this very purpose, that ye may know our state, and that he may comfort your hearts; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "together with Onesimus, the faithful and beloved brother, who is one of you. They shall make known unto you all things that ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " here.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aristarchus my fellow-prisoner saluteth you, and Mark, the cousin of Barnabas (touching whom ye received commandments; if he come unto you, receive him), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and Jesus that is called Justus, who are of the circumcision: these only ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " fellow-workers unto the kingdom of God, men that have been a comfort unto me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Epaphras, who is one of you, a servant of Christ Jesus, saluteth you, always striving for you in his prayers, that ye may stand perfect and fully assured in all the will of God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I bear him witness, that he hath much labor for you, and for them in Laodicea, and for them in Hierapolis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luke, the beloved physician, and Demas salute you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Salute the brethren that are in Laodicea, and Nymphas, and the church that is in their house. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when this epistle hath been read among you, cause that it be read also in the church of the Laodiceans; and that ye also read the epistle from Laodicea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And say to Archippus, Take heed to the ministry which thou hast received in the Lord, that thou fulfil it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The salutation of me Paul with mine own hand. Remember my bonds. Grace be with you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
